								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3538.msg39592#msg39592"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3538.msg39592#msg39592">Ray Mancini vs Duk Koo Kim</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> November 13, 2007, 11:31:29 am &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
